  "title": {"rendered": "Council&#8217;s budget vote: &#8220;We&#8217;re out of time&#8221; &amp; 3 other takeaways"},
  "content": {"rendered": "\n<p>The Example County Council voted 7&#8211;2 on Tuesday to approve a $1.2&nbsp;billion budget.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.example-ledger.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/council-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2201\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Council members debate the budget.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<script>window.adsQueue = window.adsQueue || []; adsQueue.push(\"inline-1\");</script>\n\n\n\n<p>&#8220;We&#8217;re out of time,&#8221; said Council President Ana Ruiz.</p>\n", "protected": false},
  "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>The Example County Council voted 7&#8211;2 on Tuesday to approve a $1.2&nbsp;billion budget.</p>\n", "protected": false},
